    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Preface</h2><br>This game is a fan-made game based on the IP of \u201cArknights\u201d. It is made for Arknights players. The engine is made by ikemengo. The optimization is not very good. Please bear with me. its a free game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Another way of presenting Arknights</h2><br>Release! Street! Unleash! Freedom! These are the opening words of the Emperor. After all, he is the one who organizes the street fighting competition. Compete in street fights in various places of Terra. Defeat your opponents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2> The game has various modes to choose from, such as arcade, two-player, online multiplayer, survival, lord conquest and so on. Currently, only arcade, two-player, survival and lord conquest are released in the test version. Online multiplayer is only open to the contestants for now. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441590/extras/01ffb8ccecc00b795cdf2987c807174b.poster.avif?t=1700036224\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441590/extras/01ffb8ccecc00b795cdf2987c807174b.webm?t=1700036224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441590/extras/01ffb8ccecc00b795cdf2987c807174b.mp4?t=1700036224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat your opponents with go</h2>",
